# Projekt-Standard & Technische Rahmenbedingungen für das Backend

## Tech Stack
- Sprache: Java 25
- Formatierung nach Google Java Style
- Quarkus (stable release)
- Blaze Persistence
- JPA entity classes live in `de.vocabulary.infra.repository.entity`
- JPA, SQL, and Blaze Persistence types live in `de.vocabulary.infra.repository` (and subpackages)
- Application services live in `de.vocabulary.service`
- REST (v1) lives in `de.vocabulary.interfaces.v1` (`interface` is a Java keyword and cannot be a package name)
- `de.vocabulary.domain` stays free of persistence APIs

